WEBVTT

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.200
An investigation?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.330
Yeah. You up for it?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.950
Who's the target?

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.500
There are messengers coming 
from a southern island nation.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.750
It's a nation we've had very little contact with.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.050
So you want to dig up any information you can get.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.300
That's right.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.210
I'll pay you, of course.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.720
<i>And</i> your dinner's on me tonight.

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.140
Gramps, another skewer please.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.980
No wait, two more.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:58.980
You got it.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.610
So what's the name of this nation?

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.230
Oh, it's...

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.990
<i>Tusukuru, huh?</i>

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.950
<i>Now, how am I going to get closer to them?</i>

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.430
I'm back.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.310
Whoa, are you going somewhere?

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:05.350
I'll explain later.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.690
You hurry too, Haku!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:08.440
Where are we going?

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.070
Just someplace far away.

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.490
Here, you hold on to this.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.940
Okay.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.200
Kuu!

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:24.330
Kuu-chan!

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.210
I've missed you!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.920
How have you been?

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.210
How are you here already?

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.090
That guy smelled like you.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.970
So we followed him home and hit the jackpot!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.850
Haku!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.270
You're the messengers from Tusukuru.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.230
I'm Aruruu.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:47.400
I'm Kamyu!

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:51.360
How are you related to Kuon?

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:54.690
Sisters, get off me!

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.240
Not until I get my daily dose of Vitamin Kuu!

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:58.410
Nope!

00:03:58.410 --> 00:03:59.280
Sisters?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.870
Why did you bring those two here?

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.420
They're your family, right?

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.750
So what's the problem?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.340
If you knew them, you wouldn't be saying that.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.880
Really?

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:20.890
They're the two most overprotective 
members of my family.

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.890
Your family's pretty big.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:28.560
Their coming here probably means they want to bring me back!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.400
Kuu!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.520
Kuu-chan, where are you?

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.400
Kuu!

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.610
Hey!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.400
Answer me!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.740
Kuu-chan!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.740
They're calling for you.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.700
I know...

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.900
Kuu!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.560
Did you get your hands dirty?

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.650
Let's wipey-wipey those little hands!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.410
Okay, now blowey-blowey that nose!

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.800
Kuu, can you do it by yourself?

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:38.090
Should we help?

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:40.550
I can do it by myself!

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.550
Oh, boy...

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:48.560
I've never seen my big sister like this before!

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.060
Kuu-chan!

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.440
Kuu, look!

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.860
Presents for you!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.400
Right...

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.610
Okay Kuu-chan, {now open that little mouth nice and wide!}{I've never liked "say 'ah'" in subs}{orig: Okay, Kuu-chan, say "ah!"}{too long tho}now open wide!

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:42.360
Kuu, nice and wide again.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.990
Kuon-san's having a hard time.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.120
Another one of my big sister's secrets!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.340
<i>Today's dinner even has my favorite,</i>

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:00.760
<i>but I can hardly eat it like this!</i>

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.880
Kiuru, that looks really good.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.180
Want to try one?

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.260
Can I? Thanks.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.390
<i>Haku!</i>

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.560
<i>Please notice, Haku!</i>

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.640
<i>He noticed!</i>

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.850
What?

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:17.060
<i>Haku, give me one of those.</i>

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.400
<i>Give me one of those!</i>

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.900
These?

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.410
<i>Yes! Those!</i>

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.240
<i>Not that one!</i>

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.660
<i>The one on the left!</i>

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.240
These?

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.000
<i>No! The opposite! The other side!</i>

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.660
No? These?

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:36.670
<i>Yes, those!</i>

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:40.750
Yum!{deleeeeeeeeeesh~}

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.050
Hey, Kiuru, these are great!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.300
Aw, you're exaggerating...

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:50.720
They really are good!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.430
I know, right?

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.390
I can see why Kuon recommended them.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.640
I can't stop eating them!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.650
Can't stop at just one, right?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.690
My...

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.540
Sisters...

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.460
I know you're happy to see 
me after so long, but...

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:22.550
I just wish you'd {learn}show a little restraint.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.550
Sploosh!

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:27.840
Sisters!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.300
What are you doing?

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:33.600
As your big sisters, we need 
to see how you're developing!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.270
Yes...

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.810
As your big sisters.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:40.440
C-Calm down, sisters...

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.320
Okay? I haven't changed that much...

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:44.820
No...

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:45.400
...back-talk!

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.530
Come on! Come on!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.620
Where are you touching me!?

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:53.870
Where?

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:54.660
Here.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.910
And here.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.420
And here!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.170
Stop it!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.930
{Well, looks like Little Kiuru's getting quite excited.}Looks like Kiuru's little Kiuru has made its appearance.{dick joke suggestions welcome}{orig: Kiuru's still Kiuru down there, I guess.}

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.600
Wh-What's that supposed to mean!?

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.440
Bye, Kuu.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:24.320
We have to get back to the castle.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.690
Y-Yeah.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.110
<i>Finally...</i>

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.070
See you tomorrow.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.200
Bye!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.160
<i>They'll be back tomorrow?</i>

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.710
You seemed like you were having fun.

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:46.710
Do you really think so?

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.090
What? Weren't you happy?

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:52.720
Even if they're family, there are limits.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:53.930
You wouldn't want <i>your</i>—

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:56.430
Oh, s-sorry.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.930
Nah, that doesn't bother me.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.860
Anyway, explain yourself!

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:06.980
What now?

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:11.570
At dinner, you ate all of the thing I wanted!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.740
Even though I was telling you the whole time I wanted one!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.370
No, wait.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.490
You were telling me try it 
because it was good, right?

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:21.000
I was saying "Give me one"!

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.170
Wait.

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.750
"Give me one" is more like this!

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.710
No, it's not!

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:30.670
That means "It's good, so try one"!

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.510
No, that doesn't make sense.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:36.760
"It's good, so try one" is like this, right?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.930
That's not what you just showed me!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:39.970
Huh?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.810
And it wasn't just during dinner, was it?

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:46.770
At noon, you saw me in 
trouble when they caught me,

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.280
and you pretended you didn't!

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.940
No, that was...

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:51.990
That was?

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.490
Um, well...

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:59.580
I mean, it's not that I'm unhappy to see my sisters after so long.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:05.960
But you should be able to tell 
when I'm really in trouble, right?

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.040
Don't be silly.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.290
You can, <i>right</i>?

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.920
Yes'm, I certainly can!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:13.550
Then you should've stopped them!

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:15.220
Jeez! Jeez!

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:16.930
Haku, you're so... ugh!

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.890
I hope you've learned your lesson!

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.480
It's finally over, huh?

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:37.070
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:44.460
Kuu-chan is missing!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.710
Kuu is really mad.

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:48.840
Why?

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.960
Why? Why?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.960
Why?

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.170
Well, you know...

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.970
I know exactly how she feels.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:12:01.970
My big sister's sisters are frightening enough to make her run away!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:06.270
She may have eaten something 
bad and gotten sick.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.900
Her stomach can handle 
anything you throw at it.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.150
No problem there.

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:13.530
Maybe she's gotten mixed up 
with some awful man?

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.570
I'd be more concerned for the man, honestly.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.490
Stare...

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.040
Aru-chan, could this be the awful man?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.500
It's possible.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.000
Um, can I help you?

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.040
Help us find Kuu-chan!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.000
Right now.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.170
O-Okay!

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:38.300
It's so good!

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.300
Another please, mister!

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.390
Sure thing.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:43.770
Thanks!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.100
Forget my sisters, and forget Haku!

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.520
I'm going to have a really good time today—

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.070
Kuu-chan!

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:53.570
Kuu!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.620
It doesn't smell like Kuu here.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.330
Is she really nearby?

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.370
She comes to eat the skewers here a lot.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.720
Gramps, a skewer each for the girls, please...

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.470
Sure thing.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.230
Yay!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:31.810
Yum!

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.230
Kuu likes these kinds of food.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:37.240
But she wasn't there...

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.780
Let's keep looking.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.360
That was close.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:45.740
It was a good idea to bring a scent canceler to deal with them.{is that a real thing}

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.500
But I didn't expect Haku to come with them.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.920
That little traitor!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.550
I'm <i>definitely</i> not going home now!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.890
You alone today, miss?

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:08.140
Yup.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.850
Is she over here?

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.770
Yeah, there's a candy stand up ahead.

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:15.270
Kuu does love sweets.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:21.780
Did you find her?

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.780
<i>H-How!?</i>

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.290
This looks tasty.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:33.040
Those are some unusual clothes 
you ladies are wearing.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.540
Have you come from another country, perhaps?

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.380
Yes.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.960
I'm impressed you could tell!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.960
I run a {service business}{lol japan}stall, after all.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.010
I see a lot of people.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.180
So, what'll it be?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.930
Stare...

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.560
Give them some candy.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.060
Sure. Thanks for your business!

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.320
Scrumptious.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:00.070
It's yummy, but we didn't find Kuu-chan.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.570
Let's move on.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.410
Come back soon!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:06.990
They're gone.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.790
Thanks a lot.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.240
<i>My poor wallet...</i>

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.490
<i>I need to get away from these two.</i>

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.290
Is Kuu-chan in here?

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.250
Probably.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.670
<i>I was just wandering around. 
I've never even been to this bookstore before.</i>

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:02.260
<i>There's no way Kuon's inside.</i>

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:04.590
Let's go inside.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.010
Wait!

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:11.140
<i>Well, time to go...</i>

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:15.980
Right, heading in.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:27.740
What's wrong?

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:31.620
Does Kuu-chan really buy books here?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.660
I think so?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.330
This is awful, Aru-chan!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.750
Kuu-chan's turned into a deviant!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.550
Kuu has climbed the stairway to adulthood.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.300
But something's wrong.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.920
Yeah...

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.680
But, but... I can't believe she'd 
be interested in these things.

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:54.140
Where did we go wrong in raising her?

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.680
She did tell us that she was expanding her horizons...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.560
Aru-chan!

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:58.690
Kamyucchi...

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:00.600
There, there.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.360
<i>I don't know what's going on,</i>

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:03.770
There, there.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.440
<i>but this is my chance to escape!</i>

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:07.400
Haku!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.200
Why did you bring my sisters here!?

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:10.950
Kuon!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.910
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.910
Don't tell me you <i>actually</i>—

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:20.000
I was just wandering around. 
I've never even been to this bookstore before!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.000
I thought you'd never find me here!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:23.710
Darn it!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.210
Kuu!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.210
Kuu-chan!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.260
Ow...

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.890
We finally found you.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:35.470
We were so worried!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.390
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.610
I'm sorry for worrying you!

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:45.230
Sister Aru! Sister Kamyu!

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:49.240
I'm not going back yet.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:53.990
The time we agreed upon has long since passed.

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.410
Everybody's waiting for you.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.540
I apologize for being a disobedient daughter.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.800
Please tell them that.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.680
Kuu, you're all grown up.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:14.260
But, but... Just a <i>little</i> longer, okay?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.060
We miss you, you know!

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:20.350
Take care of Kuu.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.640
Please take care of her.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.100
Don't you worry.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.610
Thank you too.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.150
I might end up worrying you again.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.320
I don't think so.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.660
These people really understand you, Kuu-chan.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.450
Take care of Kuu.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.120
We're counting on you, um...

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.040
Haku.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:50.630
Take care of her, Haku.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.170
I don't really understand, but...

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.590
Will do.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:56.850
You'll regret it if you make Kuu cry.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:59.680
If you do...

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.440
Understood!

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:07.400
Kuu, I'm glad we got to see you.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:10.190
If you're ever lonely, come straight home, okay?

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.950
I'll be fine for some time.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.950
Make sure you bathe regularly.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.950
And brush your teeth!

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.660
And wash your face.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.700
And don't forget to study!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.660
And don't catch a cold.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.670
I know! Jeez!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.220
Bye.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.510
See you later!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.560
Those two are supposed to be messengers?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.020
Don't be so rude.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.020
They know what they're doing.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:55.070
Because they're my sisters, 
and I'm very proud of them!

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.080
I thank you for coming all this way.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:11.670
We are glad to see you well, Princess,

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:16.180
and honored to have the chance to meet with you.

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:17.590
Indeed.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:24.350
We have come here to establish
friendship between our two nations.

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:11.420
So what was your take on 
the girls from Tusukuru?

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:13.130
My take?

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.170
Do they pose a threat to Yamato?

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:21.970
Nope, not a chance.

00:22:21.970 --> 00:22:25.140
At least, not unless we made a move on them first.

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:26.220
I see.

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:28.310
The same conclusion as mine, eh?

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:30.390
What is it?

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:32.270
Nothing.

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:33.810
Oh, right.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:34.690
Here.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:36.860
What's this?

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:39.400
There's a blocked drain down the street,

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.280
and they're having a hard time.

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:42.240
Huh?

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:45.950
Gramps, this should cover me and him both.

00:22:45.950 --> 00:22:46.910
Thanks.

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:49.500
Wait!

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:51.250
Counting on you, kid!

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:55.080
This is so good!

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:57.380
Should you really be eating all of that?

00:22:57.880 --> 00:22:59.130
Oh, it's fine!

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:02.380
She seems like a different 
person than she was yesterday.

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:08.510
Is Oshutoru here?

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:12.310
I heard Oshutoru comes here sometimes.

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:15.980
Is he not here today? How disappointing.

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:18.730
Who told you that?

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:19.480
It's a secret.

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:22.740
Whatcha need Oshutoru-han for?

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:24.030
Because...

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:28.120
I'm in love with him!
